# Shared look and hidden shell setup for the demo tapes. Pulled in with
# `Source`; see interactive.tape for how to record.

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "source /vhs/.github/assets/demo/bashrc"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
